# Shader sources are embedded byte-for-byte into generated *.frag.ts twins
# (scripts/sync-shader-sources.mjs). Keep them LF on every platform so a
# Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true does not make every twin "stale".
*.frag text eol=lf
*.frag.ts text eol=lf
*.vert text eol=lf
*.glsl text eol=lf
